            <description><![CDATA[<h2>LiveCopilot 2.1.0</h2>
<p>新增六步首次使用引导、右对齐小尺寸开关和应用内更新。可从设置 → 关于检查更新，自动检查可选，下载与安装由你确认。</p>
<p>更新保留模型、资料、历史、偏好和 API Key。应用与 DMG 均使用 Developer ID 签名并通过 Apple 公证。</p>
<hr>
<p>A six-step first-run guide, compact right-aligned switches, and signed in-app updates. Check for updates in Settings → About. Automatic checks are optional; you approve downloads and installation.</p>
<p>Your models, documents, history, preferences, and API keys are preserved. Both the app and DMG are Developer ID signed and Apple notarized.</p>
